We thank Dmitrii Krasheninnikov, Geoffrey Irving, Edmund Lau, Simon Marshall, Charlie Griffin, Asa Cooper Stickland for their feedback during various stages of the project.
We also thank Berkeley Existential Risk Initiative for providing fiscal support for the project.</p>
